# SONGS API

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### List songs (filter, search, sort, paginate)
GET {{baseUrl}}/songs?genre=Pop&q=love&sortBy=year&sortOrder=ASC&page=1&limit=20

### Random song
GET {{baseUrl}}/songs/random?genre=Rock

### Songs by genre
GET {{baseUrl}}/songs/genre/HipHop

### Song for an on-chain card
GET {{baseUrl}}/songs/card/1

### Song by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/songs/:id

### Create song
POST {{baseUrl}}/songs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "genre": "Afrobeat",
  "artist": "Demo Artist",
  "title": "Demo Song",
  "year": 2020,
  "lyrics": "a short original lyric line",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "tags": ["dance"],
  "source": "Original demo lyrics written for LyricsFlip (CC0)",
  "license": "CC0-1.0"
}

### Update song
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/songs/:id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "onChainCardId": "1"
}

### Delete song
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/songs/:id

### Increment play count
POST {{baseUrl}}/songs/:id/play

# Genres

### Contract genres
GET {{baseUrl}}/songs/genres

### Current user's genre preferences
GET {{baseUrl}}/songs/genres/preferences

### Record a round played in a genre
POST {{baseUrl}}/songs/genres/Pop/plays
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 80,
  "enjoymentRating": 4
}

### Recommended songs for the current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/songs/recommended
